{"id":"54a71b43597f2750","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-hif-traceability.md","title":"HIF 情形的 c.e. trace 转换为强数组","display":"thm-hif-traceability — HIF 情形的 c.e. trace 转换为强数组","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-hif-traceability","aliases":["20-thm-hif-traceability"],"display":"thm-hif-traceability — HIF 情形的 c.e. trace 转换为强数组","chapter":"11","section":"11.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 11.4.2","source_printed_pages":[193],"source_pdf_pages":[224],"depends_on":["[[20-df-traceability]]","[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-hif-traceability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-hif-traceability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hif-traceability — HIF 情形的 c.e. trace 转换为强数组"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 11.4.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>224</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a2a6dd6075aba07c\" href=\"?note=a2a6dd6075aba07c\" title=\"20-df-traceability\">20-df-traceability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(X))\">\\(\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(X))\\)</span>；trace 的大小界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为同一全可计算函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a2a6dd6075aba07c\" href=\"?note=a2a6dd6075aba07c\" title=\"20-df-traceability\">20-df-traceability</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-traceability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CETraceable}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CompTraceable}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-traceability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CETraceable}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CompTraceable}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给任意全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\le_T X\">\\(f\\le_T X\\)</span> 及 c.e. trace <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{h_0(n)}\">\\(W_{h_0(n)}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(n)=\\mu s[f(n)\\in W_{h_0(n),s}]\">\\(t(n)=\\mu s[f(n)\\in W_{h_0(n),s}]\\)</span>。它全且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 可计算。HIF 给普通可计算最终时间界，有限修补后处处为界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(n)\">\\(b(n)\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_1(n)=\\operatorname{fcode}(W_{h_0(n),b(n)})\">\\(h_1(n)=\\operatorname{fcode}(W_{h_0(n),b(n)})\\)</span>，该函数全可计算；截取仍包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)\">\\(f(n)\\)</span>，基数仍不超过同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(n)\">\\(p(n)\\)</span>。反向从有限完整代码统一编译 c.e. 索引即可。转换没有改变原有的“同一 p 对全部 f”的量词次序。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.4.2；印刷页 193；PDF 第 224 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-traceability","status":"resolved","id":"a2a6dd6075aba07c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-traceability]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-traceability","status":"resolved","id":"a2a6dd6075aba07c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-traceability]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor